  "note": "-20 DC, EIM, at a station whose meter counts 10 % too much and signs what it misread. The car compares every reading with its own count and, set to 5 %, ends the charging after the first one, 880 Wh against 800. Its SessionStopReq says why: EVTerminationCode urn:openchargingcloud:EVTerminationCode:MeteringDeviation, and the four figures in EVTerminationExplanation. The first recorded message in which a vehicle tells the station its meter is wrong.",
